{"i":12,"start_s":58.5,"end_s":59.93,"speaker":"SPEAKER_02","speaker_conf":"high","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Americans are concerned"}
{"i":13,"start_s":59.93,"end_s":76.01,"speaker":"SPEAKER_01","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"about a government takeover of healthcare, and for good reason. And it goes on. So recognize that that is a point that's coming from a document about how to kill healthcare, not a responsible debate about the plan we have"}
