{"i":26,"start_s":124.23,"end_s":136.41,"speaker":"SPEAKER_02","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"that comes right out of those talking points, \"to give up their private health care plan, to be pushed into a Washington-run government plan,\" right out of those talking points. They don't want to wait two years for surgery."}
